<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35420" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέργ-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>action, activity, operation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.8.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				4.51
			</span></i> (of the labours of Heracles), <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.213
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				4.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				158
			</span></i>, al.: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					4.13
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάθος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				2.59
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.134
			</span></i>, Chrysipp.ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.295
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>realized object,</i> [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοῦς] αὑτοῦ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.8.16
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				6.9.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> dub. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνάργημα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1p.4U.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κατὰ φιλοσοφίαν ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Metrod.
					<u>Herc.</u>
					831.8
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				2.68
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
